
Advanced data analytics road support:

1. Understand who creates value for the business (Customers). I frame them as the business object that is responsible for creating the value of the business.
2. Understand what created value for the business (Products). Another business object that facilitates the behavior of WHO CREATES VALUE (customers).
3. Unnderstand who are supplying values for the business (Sellers). Analyze what distinguish top-performing sellers and their correlation with the top performing categoories
